{"book":"ezra","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T12:55:15.490337895Z","verse":2,"ref":"ezra 1:2","tier":"bulk","chapter":1,"translation":"Thus says Cyrus king of Persia, 'All kingdoms of the earth ⟨the⟩ YHWH, ⟨the⟩ Elohim of heaven, ⟨has⟩ given to me, and He ⟨has⟩ charged me to build ⟨to⟩ Him ⟨a⟩ house in Jerusalem, which ⟨is⟩ in Judah.'","tokens":[{"surface":"כה","gloss":"Thus"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"says"},{"surface":"כרש","gloss":"Cyrus"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"king"},{"surface":"פרס","gloss":"of Persia"},{"surface":"כל","gloss":"All"},{"surface":"ממלכות","gloss":"kingdoms"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"of the earth"},{"surface":"נתן","gloss":"has given"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"to me"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"אלהי","gloss":"the Elohim of"},{"surface":"השמים","gloss":"of heaven"},{"surface":"והוא","gloss":"and He"},{"surface":"פקד","gloss":"has charged"},{"surface":"עלי","gloss":"upon me"},{"surface":"לבנות","gloss":"to build"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"⟨to⟩ Him"},{"surface":"בית","gloss":"a house"},{"surface":"בירושלם","gloss":"in Jerusalem"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"which"},{"surface":"ביהודה","gloss":"is in Judah"}]}